  <item>
    <title>EP132:穿搭指南|打工人早八大作战，5分钟穿出满分气场！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae5fc54c96c8942ec153b2d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae5fc54c96c8942ec153b2d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天气转凉，大家理完自己的秋冬衣橱了吗？</span></p><p><strong><span>衣橱满满，但为啥没衣服穿</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 千万不要让父母插手衣橱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 同类型的款式不能再买了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> 时尚是个圈，但我们似乎不是</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 心心念念的新风格</span></p><p><strong><span>上班之后，我到底该穿什么</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 影视剧穿搭靠谱吗？不靠谱!</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 恶心穿搭，非常不推荐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> 穿搭博主真的上过班吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 稳重、古板、显老-都是好词</span></p><p><strong><span>雷霆穿搭，那是我们的来时路</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a> 避雷穿搭①-不合适的单品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> 避雷穿搭②-全身风格不统一</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2277">37:57</a> 避雷穿搭③-为了搭配而搭配</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 避雷穿搭④-不符合实际年龄</span></p><p><strong><span>人靠衣装，好的搭配让人气场全开</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> 一衣多穿，理想很好，但现实…</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">44:03</a> 有些配饰真的很加分</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2878">47:58</a> 不盲从，新买只留80分以上穿搭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3097">51:37</a> 找到适合自己的风格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3253">54:13</a> 舍弃近3年穿着频率过低的衣服</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3356">55:56</a> 西装-要的就是那个范儿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3879">1:04:39</a> 衣服靠试，可以买，但不强留</span></p><p><strong><span>最后，祝大家都找到自己的满分穿搭~</span></strong></p><p><span>📀BGM</span></p><p><span>生活本意是开心-雯雅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62664b9a31d3feaed5f7da45/lluHgz6Lrwb-NrNMN3jAA09QmEJI.m4a" length="74044100" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fos8_hn1LYCyGBwkQtqvzm9SU1Pw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP131:化妆护肤|那些我们交过的智商税&amp;好物分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad3ac52641ef406308d30fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad3ac52641ef406308d30fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>购物节又要来啦，大家要理性消费哦～</span></p><p><strong><span>化妆篇</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 打工人必备10分钟早八妆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> 防晒/隔离：上妆服帖的前提</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">11:09</a> 素颜霜/气垫/隔离：提气色好物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a> 修容/遮瑕/眉毛：妆面整洁度upup</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a> 口红收尾！精神感妆容get～</span></p><p><strong><span>护肤篇</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">26:03</a> 卸妆/洗面奶：国货便宜大碗至上</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2011">33:31</a> 洗脸巾：强推胖东来，洗脸巾的花式用法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a> KK爽肤水：干皮一年四季不可或缺滋润养肤水</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2786">46:26</a> 獭獺爽肤水：油皮必备剥脱类水</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3342">55:42</a> KK精华小课堂：关注核心成分，PDRN-维稳；玻色因-抗衰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4272">1:11:12</a> KK干皮面霜：娇兰的熬夜霜空瓶7支，偏爱油润功效型</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4588">1:16:28</a> 獭獺油皮面霜：无油感面霜爱好者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4820">1:20:20</a> 面膜大户KK：干皮请多多使用～让脸蛋时刻保持滋润</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5120">1:25:20</a> 宗旨：想要有效护肤，必要神农尝百草</span></p><p><strong><span>双十一刹车键：普通女生一年护肤消耗量大公开</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5201">1:26:41</a> 卸妆/洗面：一年300～700ml（最多囤4瓶）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5284">1:28:04</a> 爽肤水：一年400～900ml（最多囤4瓶）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5366">1:29:26</a> 精华：一年200～300ml（最多囤5瓶50ml)</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5478">1:31:18</a>面霜：一年200～300ml（最多囤4瓶50ml)</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5499">1:31:39</a>面膜：一年50-150片（最多一次性买50-80片)</span></p><p><span>📀BGM</span></p><p><span>生活本意是开心-雯雅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62664b9a31d3feaed5f7da45/lkvd2UzF-TcS1f9-HWeZsggJrvTl.m4a" length="94451121" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:37:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fos8_hn1LYCyGBwkQtqvzm9SU1Pw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP130:工位抽屉|从解馋到养生，一键开启过日子模式</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac904bfe742e36efcc084cf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac904bfe742e36efcc084cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>学期伊始，KK又换了新的办公室，那今天就来聊一聊我们给自己搭建的办公室小仓库吧～</span></em></p><p><strong><span>小确幸第一步：搞定工位玄学</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 左高右低，风生水起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 背靠实墙，心里有底</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> 左手绿植，招财顺风</span></p><p><strong><span>小确幸第二步：常备小小药库</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 常见必备：感冒+消炎+灭病毒，维持牛马开工的必备药</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> 职业需要：润喉糖（京都念慈庵+桉叶糖）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> KK养生局： 泡腾片冲水吨吨喝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 其余按需配备，切记跟风哦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> 獭獺养生局：梳头大业开启中</span></p><p><strong><span>小确幸第三步：零食库搞起来！</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> KK：午餐吃零食，满满幸福感！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 常备巧克力，快乐救急两不误</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> 果脯类很美味，但要警惕变质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2671">44:31</a> 猎奇零嘴，给上班来点新鲜感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3107">51:47</a>最后：记得给工位来点专属装饰哦～</span></p><p><span>📀BGM</span></p><p><span>生活本意是开心-雯雅</span></p>]]></description>
