  <item>
    <title>EP129:周末计划|剧场里心动，书店里安心，把觉知带回生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac08b64e742e36efcbdf2e9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac08b64e742e36efcbdf2e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 05:05:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>今天想和大家分享两段愉快的周末时光~</span></strong></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><strong><em><span>第一场快乐周末：下班去看音乐剧《破墙》啦</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 成功种草《破墙》觉醒线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 故事概要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 三位主人公</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">18:41</a> 剧情讨论</span></p><p><strong><em><span>衍生小讨论：怎样才是“做自己的君王”</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1712">28:32</a> 命运啊，难道就这样了吗？不！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 命盘下不同的人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 卜以决疑，不疑何卜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 如何选择确定感？只要不后悔</span></p><p><strong><em><span>第二场快乐周末：逛逛多抓鱼循环书店（实体版）</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a> 跳出工作循环</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">51:21</a> 目标明确是好事嘛？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3244">54:04</a> 约会好去处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a> 各种有趣的书</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3811">1:03:31</a> 出门享受真实的阳光真实的微风</span></p><p><span>📀BGM</span></p><p><span>生活本意是开心-雯雅</span></p>]]></description>
