  <item>
    <title>EP126:济州岛记|看海、购物两不误，旅游城市看点大揭秘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8874321352af56ff39fa1a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a8874321352af56ff39fa1a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年两个人一起出游的地点定在了韩国的济州岛，本期是一期游玩感想，行程单先行奉上~</span></p><p><span>D1：射击场-柱状节里带-偶来小路-无人的街道-正房瀑布-偶来市场</span></p><p><span>D2：牛岛-白沙滩-牛岛峰-黑沙滩-城山日出峰</span></p><p><span>D3：涯月邑海岸线-狭才海水浴场-小羊肖恩-市区逛街</span></p><p><span>D4：市区买买买</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 行前准备-电话卡、现金和保险</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> 济州岛攻略-上下左右，任君挑选，最后加上汉拿山</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> </span><strong><span>困惑1-</span></strong><span>“我们在正确的游玩路线上吗？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 小小城市如何玩出花儿？创造出片场景+强相关纪念品+海上项目。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> 从“你”的全世界路过——天地渊瀑布</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> </span><strong><span>困惑2</span></strong><span>-韩国人不吃蔬菜的嘛？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 论口味清淡的两个人如何选择食谱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 超级昂贵的出行费用，是汇率差麻痹了我们！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> 牛岛，牛岛，营销鬼才岛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3059">50:59</a> </span><strong><span>困惑3</span></strong><span>-国外真的不讲究酒店风水吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3296">54:56</a> 城山日出峰-拍照教学中</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3474">57:54</a> 涯月邑海岸线到底怎么玩？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4060">1:07:40</a> 韩国各种保健品盛行原因大猜测</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4614">1:16:54</a> 小羊肖恩-小动物让人心软软</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4869">1:21:09</a> 购物-务必开动聪明的小脑瓜，省钱义不容辞！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5386">1:29:46</a> 韩国好吃好玩好买大集合</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5587">1:33:07</a> 不要理那些奇奇怪怪的用中文喇叭喊话的人</span></p><p><span>祝大家以后旅游愉快~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62664b9a31d3feaed5f7da45/ljw8d1C3SjfiTA60W22brFqGPds5.m4a" length="98896000" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:43:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fos8_hn1LYCyGBwkQtqvzm9SU1Pw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP125:人性思考|懂得感恩的人，是被怎样养大的？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a71e01a1b5e24969ce8db46</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a71e01a1b5e24969ce8db46</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>今天和大家一起聊聊“感恩”那些事~</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 从孩子视角来看：感恩如何养成？白眼狼又如何养成？</span></p><p><strong><span>Part1：小时候的我们，到底懂不懂感恩？</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 开智前，我们更多的是索取/跟随去感恩，总感觉流于形式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 感恩不等同于共情，</span><strong><span>感恩-你本可以不这么对我，但你选择了善待</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Part2：如何培养感恩？</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 感恩不存在性别差异，而是靠家长一举一动的家庭教育养出来的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 不可“甩锅式”育儿，既要又要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 爱不可与奖励机制挂钩，避免产生被爱是有条件的误解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 教养方式中，溺爱型父母容易把放任=爱；</span></p><p><span>        而专制型父母则容易让孩子没有自我选择空间。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 孩子尽早的参与家庭决策，将单向付出变成双向互动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a> 避免长大后才能感知父母之不易</span></p><p><strong><span>Part3：顺境VS逆境</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3077">51:17</a> 逆境才能唤醒感恩之心？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3288">54:48</a> 公益视频也能有效传递社会导向，但切记自我标榜</span></p><p><strong><span>最后，激发感恩的潜能需要我们从被动的“家庭教育”转化为主动的“自我修行”</span></strong></p><p><span>📀BGM</span></p><p><span>生活本意是开心-雯雅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62664b9a31d3feaed5f7da45/lranPcvtfXgTdB7XLcF5Jj3PZvrQ.m4a" length="57236672" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fos8_hn1LYCyGBwkQtqvzm9SU1Pw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP124:《20岁,光阴不再来》|别把最值钱的十年，当成随便挥霍的过渡期</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5e11446356eb2d9be58c39</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5e11446356eb2d9be58c39</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“20多岁，你的人生是不是卡出了？”——梅格·杰伊</span></p><p><strong><span>读书分享第24期</span></strong></p><p><span>作品：美国作者梅格·杰伊所著的《20岁，光阴不再来》，陈磊、袁靖亚翻译，广西科学技术出版社</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 在20岁时读的书，25岁看是什么感觉？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 20岁最大的骗局,就是:</span><strong><span>我还有很多很多时间</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Part 1：拆掉“慢慢来”的假象</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 人的一生80%的认识关键抉择，收入差距，婚姻状态，</span><strong><span>全部落在35岁之前。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Part 2：什么是“身份资本”？</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a> 定义:未来能让你变得</span><strong><span>更值钱</span></strong><span>，可以</span><strong><span>重复被使用</span></strong><span>的技能，经验，思维等</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 别做:</span><strong><span>当下舒服，当下轻松，但未来归零</span></strong><span>的事情！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 但普通人的20岁-刚毕业，没人引导，不会布局</span></p><p><strong><em><span>*精英叙事陷阱:</span></em></strong><em><span>我们才不是不想主动积累身份资本，这是当代的“结构性困境”而非不够主动，不购卖力。</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> 理想蓝图:澳洲WHV签证</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2486">41:26</a> 经典励志公式:</span><strong><em><span>1的365次方=1；1.01的365次方=2？，不，是37.8！</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><span>Part 3：为什么越宅越普通? 没用上弱关系</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a> 20岁的我-抹不开面，不屑于和不熟悉的人small talk</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 舒适圈中的人只能安慰，共情，而非带你升级</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 弱关系-</span><strong><span>拥有你完全接触不到的新信息，新机会，新圈层</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3348">55:48</a> 不是刻意社交，刻意讨好，是</span><strong><span>让自己活在流动的世界里！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Part <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a>+随便恋爱，是成本最高的消遣</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3632">1:00:32</a> 经典辩论:如果明知会分手，你还会选择开始吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3759">1:02:39</a> KK：爱情是自由意志的选择，而非一个客观的商业判断。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3915">1:05:15</a> 请不要</span><strong><span>惯性恋爱，惯性同居，惯性结婚。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4077">1:07:57</a> 獭獺力推：婚前29问</span></p><ol><li><p><em><span>生育观-</span></em><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4138">1:08:58</a></span></em></p></li><li><p><em><span>事业观（通勤/居住地选择）-</span></em><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4490">1:14:50</a></span></em></p></li><li><p><em><span>生活态度-</span></em><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4945">1:22:25</a></span></em></p></li><li><p><em><span>家庭资助是必须品吗-</span></em><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5341">1:29:01</a></span></em></p></li></ol><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6010">1:40:10</a> 世界上不存在100%复制品，</span><strong><span>解决问题＞解决人</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Part <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">5:20</a>+请积极重塑你的大脑</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6532">1:48:52</a> 20+，唯一由自己进行大脑重塑的时期。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6769">1:52:49</a> 一切都还来得及，一切都由你定义~</span></p><p><span>📀BGM</span></p><p><span>生活本意是开心-雯雅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62664b9a31d3feaed5f7da45/lhoDLUGMYaqKanHpo78Hg3v769Q8.m4a" length="108098028" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:56:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fos8_hn1LYCyGBwkQtqvzm9SU1Pw.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
