  <item>
    <title>EP123:三伏养生|科学调养30日，元气满满过金秋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5309584adef2b365628a69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5309584adef2b365628a69</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 03:31:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天和大家聊聊三伏天的我们如何养生~</span></p><p><strong><span>三伏养生第一步-吸收日月精华，晒太阳</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 灵魂拷问-要白还是要健康</span></p><p><strong><span>三伏养生第二步-寻求专家帮助，做针灸</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 医生医生，我到底怎么了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 电子把脉，科技真发达啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">11:24</a> 对症扎针，多和医生唠唠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 居然还能减肥？那可来劲了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 医生推荐的一周2-3次，真的能实现吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1849">30:49</a> 针灸附带的好处多多</span></p><p><strong><span>三伏养生第三步-管住嘴，迈开腿，早睡早起身体好</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a> 连环5问-“放纵餐”都吃不了吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a> “我能吃冰激凌吗？”“非常不建议。”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> “你是不是又晚睡了？”“我一定可以早起！”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2638">43:58</a> 为什么早睡反而脸色更差了？50天后见分晓</span></p><p><strong><span>三伏养生第四步-随手养生小方法</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 各类茶包泡起来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2863">47:43</a> 养生食品多斟酌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3175">52:55</a> AI诊断需小心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3202">53:22</a> 艾灸敷贴选一个</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3341">55:41</a> 泡脚用水功效佳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">1:03:00</a> 食疗总比吃药强</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4211">1:10:11</a> 水果有时有奇效</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4378">1:12:58</a> 越虚动动反而好</span></p><p><strong><span>最后，中医治根，坚持调养，祝大家身体健康！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
