  <item>
    <title>EP121: 618雷霆女装|尺码、面料、版型全是大坑！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2e33bb43a22a69558363d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a2e33bb43a22a69558363d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 04:57:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>依旧快乐 “剁手”，拒绝报复性买买买</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 今年新增服饰消费主,开启 “火眼金睛”模式。</span></p><p><strong><em><span>吐槽大会开启中：</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> 【大型翻车】老牌宝藏店也踩雷！夏装质感断崖式下跌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> 【面料陷阱】警惕花里胡哨的面料名词，全是文字游戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 【闲置处理】不合适的衣服别扔掉，挂二手平台轻松回血。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 【硬核吐槽】女装尺码 &amp; 版型乱象，简直为难普通人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> 【细节拉胯】男女装差距明显，内衣网购千万别踩坑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 【所谓设计】盗版衣服遍地走，只抄外形不做品质</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 【礼服踩雷】网红礼服裙批量粗制滥造，踩雷率 100%</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a>【女鞋大坑】网购鞋子水太深，同款不同价全是套路</span></p><p><strong><em><span>火眼金睛开启中：</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">27:07</a>【时尚轮回】发夹、坡跟鞋、轮番回潮，时尚是个圈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1747">29:07</a>【风格探索】穿搭看体质看长相，多试才是真谛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a>【衣橱管理】两种穿搭思路：精简衣橱 VS 每日换新</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2824">47:04</a> 【选购干货】划重点！买衣服记住：重质感，少而精</span></p><p><strong><span>最后，理性买衣，从你我做起！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>欢迎大家分享私藏好店，也不要忘记订阅关注我们哦~</span></strong></p><p><span>📀BGM</span></p><p><span>生活本意是开心-雯雅</span></p>]]></description>
